/-!
# S9-C3h153: linear-Plebanski-aware synchronized local actual lift

C3h152 generated the interaction-sensitive P506/L0 local actual `U₂`.
Restricting `U₂` to its canonical Cauchy contact gives a genuine dynamical
state, but the older generic joint lift would regenerate the gravity
curvature as `⋆ᵢ B` and thereby erase the nonzero multiplier response.

This module corrects the producer, not a residual:

```text
exact P506/L0 source
→ action-generated U₂
→ canonical Cauchy contact of U₂
→ linear-Plebanski action target F = ⋆ᵢ B - λ
→ Cauchy-faithful Lorentz first jet
→ synchronized nine-field local actual U₃.
```

The Lorentz velocity and the purely spatial antisymmetric jet are generated
directly from the linear-Plebanski action target.  The remaining coframe,
auxiliary, multiplier, P286, scalar, matter, and conjugate-matter fields come
from the existing joint action lift.  No residual, endpoint, inverse
principal, range witness, curvature certificate, supplied target, coefficient,
or branch receipt is accepted by the constructor.

This is still an origin first-jet producer.  It does not claim a whole-slice
integral curve, global extension, finite action, or complete Stage-9
stationarity.
-/

